---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<Layout title="About" description="Learn about Surrey Neurotech Society — our mission, focus areas, and what members can expect from our student-led neurotech community.">

  <section class="bg-primary text-text-on-dark py-16 sm:py-20 px-6 neural-wave-bg-dark curve-bottom relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl relative z-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
        <span class="w-8 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-accent/60 to-transparent"></span>
        <span class="text-accent text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">About Us</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight">About Surrey Neurotech Society</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-text-on-dark-secondary text-lg max-w-2xl">Where neuroscience meets technology — driven by curiosity and grounded in science.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0"><div class="neural-pathway"></div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 px-6">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Our Mission</h2>
          <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Surrey Neurotech Society exists to bring together students interested in the intersection of neuroscience, technology, and engineering. We explore how the brain works, how technology can interface with it, and what this means for medicine, computing, and society.
          </p>
          <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">
            We're a student-led society under Surrey Students' Union, run by students who believe that understanding the brain is one of the most important challenges of our time — and that students from every discipline can contribute to it.
          </p>
          <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Our events span from accessible introductions to deeper technical discussions. We're not a research lab — we're a community of curious students who want to learn, discuss, and build together.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-8 border-transparent relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-muted to-transparent opacity-30"></div>
          <div class="relative z-10">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-6 text-primary-deep">What to Expect</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-4">
              <li class="flex gap-3">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
                <span class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">Introductory talks on neuroscience, BCIs, and neurotechnology</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-3">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
                <span class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">Research reading groups and journal clubs</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-3">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
                <span class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">Hands-on projects with EEG and neural signal processing</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-3">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
                <span class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">Careers panels focused on neurotech and neuroscience pathways</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-3">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
                <span class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">A welcoming, interdisciplinary community</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-surface-alt py-16 sm:py-20 px-6">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Who Is This For?</h2>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 border-transparent hover:border-accent/30 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-3">Neuroscience Students</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">Deepen your understanding beyond lectures and connect with peers who share your interest in the brain.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 border-transparent hover:border-secondary/30 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-3">Engineers & Computer Scientists</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">Interested in BCIs, signal processing, or biomedical engineering? This is your space to explore those applications.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 border-transparent hover:border-accent/30 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-3">Curious Minds</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">No background required. If you're curious about how the brain works and what technology can do, you're welcome here.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 px-6">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-8">Our Focus Areas</h2>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-accent-muted flex items-center justify-center text-accent shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">01</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Brain-Computer Interfaces</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">The technology that lets brains communicate directly with machines.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-secondary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-secondary shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">02</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Computational Neuroscience</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">Modelling and understanding neural systems through mathematics and simulation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-accent-muted flex items-center justify-center text-accent shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">03</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Neuroethics</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">The ethical implications of reading, stimulating, and augmenting the human brain.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-secondary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-secondary shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">04</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Wellbeing & Mental Health Tech</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">How neurotechnology can support mental health, accessibility, and human flourishing.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
